1
00:00:43,200 --> 00:00:45,230
Aren't you afraid of dying here?

2
00:00:45,600 --> 00:00:46,530
I told you,

3
00:00:46,960 --> 00:00:48,360
I want to go up the mountain

4
00:00:48,360 --> 00:00:49,630
to see High God Puti.

5
00:00:52,200 --> 00:00:53,760
You passed the mountain pass.

6
00:00:53,760 --> 00:00:55,160
Your mind is firm enough.

7
00:00:55,300 --> 00:00:56,160
Go up.

8
00:00:56,460 --> 00:00:59,900
The High God knew the one with the ancient divine vein would come,

9
00:00:59,900 --> 00:01:03,030
and has been waiting under the Bodhi tree for a long time.

10
00:01:03,630 --> 00:01:04,430
Thank you.

11
00:01:14,860 --> 00:01:15,900
I am Bai Li,

12
00:01:16,400 --> 00:01:18,400
paying my respects to High God Puti.

13
00:01:19,260 --> 00:01:20,800
You broke into the Heavenly Realm for him,

14
00:01:20,800 --> 00:01:21,860
fought the Xiezhi,

15
00:01:22,000 --> 00:01:23,860
and almost lost your life.

16
00:01:23,860 --> 00:01:24,760
Is it worth it?

17
00:01:25,830 --> 00:01:27,860
There is no such thing as worth it or not,

18
00:01:27,860 --> 00:01:28,590
only willing

19
00:01:29,160 --> 00:01:29,960
or unwilling.

20
00:01:30,060 --> 00:01:32,759
The Nirvana Bodhi Fruit is the spiritual root of heaven and earth,

21
00:01:32,759 --> 00:01:34,759
bearing only one fruit every ten thousand years.

22
00:01:34,759 --> 00:01:35,759
It can bring the dead back to life,

23
00:01:35,759 --> 00:01:36,759
restore flesh to bones,

24
00:01:36,759 --> 00:01:37,729
renew vitality,

25
00:01:37,729 --> 00:01:38,960
and reshape the soul.

26
00:01:39,130 --> 00:01:40,560
But it defies the heavens and changes fate,

27
00:01:40,560 --> 00:01:42,360
so it cannot be given to you for nothing.

28
00:01:42,360 --> 00:01:43,300
To take it,

29
00:01:43,360 --> 00:01:45,700
you must exchange it for something of equal value.

30
00:01:45,700 --> 00:01:46,500
As long as I have it,

31
00:01:46,500 --> 00:01:47,900
I can exchange anything.

32
00:01:49,759 --> 00:01:50,729
What if it is

33
00:01:51,200 --> 00:01:53,100
your ancient divine vein?

34
00:01:53,300 --> 00:01:55,860
You possess a rare ancient divine vein.

35
00:01:56,160 --> 00:01:57,930
Although your divine bone was extracted,

36
00:01:57,930 --> 00:01:59,590
the divine vein still exists.

37
00:01:59,700 --> 00:02:02,400
Once awakened, you will be unrivaled in the Six Realms,

38
00:02:02,400 --> 00:02:03,660
live as long as heaven,

39
00:02:03,800 --> 00:02:05,400
and have a boundless future.

40
00:02:05,560 --> 00:02:07,000
If you offer your divine vein,

41
00:02:07,000 --> 00:02:08,600
your immortal roots will be severed,

42
00:02:08,600 --> 00:02:10,060
and your divine power will be lost.

43
00:02:10,060 --> 00:02:11,790
You will be reduced to a mortal,

44
00:02:12,130 --> 00:02:13,660
experiencing birth, aging, sickness, and death,

45
00:02:13,660 --> 00:02:15,260
with no more magical powers.

46
00:02:15,800 --> 00:02:16,700
I am willing.

47
00:02:18,000 --> 00:02:19,730
Won't you think about it again?

48
00:02:19,930 --> 00:02:21,130
Once it is extracted,

49
00:02:21,300 --> 00:02:22,930
there is no turning back.

50
00:02:23,530 --> 00:02:25,130
No matter how long my life is,

51
00:02:25,600 --> 00:02:27,530
it's not as good as him living well.

52
00:02:41,260 --> 00:02:43,160
It's not too late to regret now.

53
00:02:44,660 --> 00:02:45,400
I

54
00:02:46,030 --> 00:02:47,030
don't regret it.

55
00:02:56,260 --> 00:02:57,100
Go back.

56
00:02:57,800 --> 00:02:59,260
Don't miss the time.

57
00:03:16,930 --> 00:03:18,060
How is it, God of War?

58
00:03:18,200 --> 00:03:19,000
Did you get it?

59
00:03:23,300 --> 00:03:23,760
I got it.

60
00:03:29,460 --> 00:03:31,430
This Bodhi Divine Tree is at the peak of Lingshan,

61
00:03:31,430 --> 00:03:33,100
guarded by ancient divine beasts.

62
00:03:33,100 --> 00:03:35,400
For ten thousand years, no one has been able to take the fruit alive.

63
00:03:35,400 --> 00:03:36,630
I wonder, Your Highness,

64
00:03:36,630 --> 00:03:38,090
how did you get this fruit?

65
00:03:39,730 --> 00:03:40,530
It's nothing.

66
00:03:41,430 --> 00:03:44,090
I just exchanged it with my ancient divine vein.

67
00:03:46,100 --> 00:03:46,760
What?

68
00:03:47,760 --> 00:03:49,160
The ancient divine vein?

69
00:03:49,530 --> 00:03:51,530
That is the foundation of your cultivation!

70
00:03:51,530 --> 00:03:52,360
Without the divine vein,

71
00:03:52,360 --> 00:03:53,020
you will...

72
00:03:54,300 --> 00:03:56,200
This is the only way to save Cangyuan.

73
00:03:56,200 --> 00:03:56,800
Remember,

74
00:03:57,230 --> 00:03:59,560
you must keep this a secret from Cangyuan.

75
00:04:18,029 --> 00:04:18,700
My wife.

76
00:04:21,130 --> 00:04:21,459
I...

77
00:04:22,200 --> 00:04:23,200
I'm not dead?

78
00:04:30,230 --> 00:04:30,690
This...

79
00:04:31,260 --> 00:04:32,659
What exactly is going on?

80
00:04:34,360 --> 00:04:36,690
This is all thanks to the God of War, Bai Li.

81
00:04:36,900 --> 00:04:37,700
She saved you.

82
00:04:43,600 --> 00:04:44,860
Why do you look so pale?

83
00:04:45,530 --> 00:04:47,700
Did saving me consume too much of your spiritual power?

84
00:04:47,700 --> 00:04:48,600
You're overthinking.

85
00:04:48,600 --> 00:04:49,200
Who am I?

86
00:04:49,600 --> 00:04:50,600
I am the God of War.

87
00:04:50,930 --> 00:04:53,260
Saving you was as easy as lifting a finger.

88
00:04:53,260 --> 00:04:53,720
Really?

89
00:04:56,200 --> 00:04:56,600
What?

90
00:04:57,030 --> 00:04:58,630
You don't believe your wife?

91
00:04:59,800 --> 00:05:00,130
I do.

92
00:05:01,260 --> 00:05:02,060
Of course I do.

93
00:05:05,030 --> 00:05:06,690
Now that Zhaohan is crippled,

94
00:05:07,060 --> 00:05:09,300
and the immortals and demons are at peace,

95
00:05:09,300 --> 00:05:10,960
I want to stay in the mortal realm,

96
00:05:10,960 --> 00:05:12,860
find a place with beautiful scenery,

97
00:05:12,860 --> 00:05:14,260
and live a peaceful life.

98
00:05:15,030 --> 00:05:15,430
You...

99
00:05:16,130 --> 00:05:17,730
Are you willing to be with me?

100
00:05:19,530 --> 00:05:20,030
I am.

101
00:05:20,530 --> 00:05:21,260
I am willing.

102
00:05:21,860 --> 00:05:24,320
I've long been tired of being the Demon Lord.

103
00:05:24,630 --> 00:05:27,100
Once I go back and pass the throne to my second brother,

104
00:05:27,100 --> 00:05:28,460
I'll follow you from now on.

105
00:05:28,460 --> 00:05:29,790
I'll go wherever you go.

106
00:05:30,200 --> 00:05:32,200
Farming, chopping wood, washing clothes, and cooking,

107
00:05:32,200 --> 00:05:33,000
I'll do it all.

108
00:05:36,100 --> 00:05:37,100
That sounds nice,

109
00:05:37,760 --> 00:05:40,730
but last time you blew up the pot while brewing medicine.

110
00:05:40,730 --> 00:05:42,600
That was because I had no experience.

111
00:05:42,600 --> 00:05:43,760
I'll practice every day,

112
00:05:43,760 --> 00:05:45,159
and I'll definitely cook better than a master chef.
